laravel.body:
Gunakan `with(['relation'])` untuk menghindari N+1 query. Contoh:
```php
// ❌ N+1 — 100 query
$posts = Post::all();
foreach ($posts as $post) {
    echo $post->author->name;
}

// ✅ Eager — 2 query
$posts = Post::with('author')->get();
foreach ($posts as $post) {
    echo $post->author->name;
}
```

php.body:
`??` operator adalah shortcut untuk `isset()` ternary:
```php
// Manual
$name = isset($_GET['name']) ? $_GET['name'] : 'default';

// Modern
$name = $_GET['name'] ?? 'default';

// Nested?
$name = $_GET['name'] ?? $_POST['name'] ?? 'default';
```

security.body:
Raw output itu berbahaya. Gunakan `{!! !!}` hanya untuk HTML yang sudah distrip:
```php
// ❌ Vulnerable
{{ $user->bio }}

// ✅ Safe (auto-escaped)
{{ $user->bio }}

// ✅ For HTML content
{!! Purify::clean($user->bio) !!}
```

architecture.body:
Pisahkan logika database dari business logic:
```php
interface UserRepositoryInterface {
    public function findById(int $id): ?User;
    public function findByEmail(string $email): ?User;
}
```
